.claude/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
data/sms.db*
# Runtime state, never source. The hard-reset marker is read by
# `_hard_reset_on_cooldown()`, so a timestamp committed from someone's test run and then
# deployed would silently suppress a legitimate hard reset for half an hour.
data/modem_hard_reset_at
# Undelivered alerts waiting for a route out. Runtime state; a spool committed from one
# machine would replay its alerts on another.
data/alert_spool.jsonl
.env
venv/
*.mo
docs/superpowers/
AGENTS.md
